学洽闻，故前欲令卿一诣许，交见朝士，以折中国妄语兒。卿不原行，便使子纲；恐子纲不能结兒辈舌也。”翻曰：“翻是明府家宝，而以示人，人倘留之，则去明府良佐，故前不行耳。”策笑曰：“然。”因曰：“孤有征讨事，未得还府，卿复以功曹为吾萧何，守会稽耳。”后三日，便遣翻还郡。　　","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line013-pei01-02:m0007","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"策","kind":"person","person_id":"e9c_070_567","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line013-pei01-02:m0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"黄祖","kind":"person","person_id":"318_d06_496","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line013-pei01-02:m0022","start":22,"end":23,"surface":"翻","kind":"person","person_id":"izi_e36_p1g","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line013-pei01-02:m0027","start":27,"end":30,"surface":"华子鱼","kind":"person","person_id":"7zi_5gs_mq2","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line013-pei01-02:m0078","start":78,"end":79,"surface":"翻","kind":"person","person_id":"izi_e36_p1g","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line013-pei01-02:m0102","start":102,"end":103,"surface":"歆","kind":"person","person_id":"7zi_5gs_mq2","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line013-pei01-02:m0121","start":121,"end":124,"surface":"王府君","kind":"person","person_id":"d21_081_910","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line013-pei01-02:m0126","start":126,"end":127,"surface":"歆","kind":"person","person_id":"7zi_5gs_mq2","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line013-pei01-02:m0135","start":135,"end":136,"surface":"翻","kind":"person","person_id":"izi_e36_p1g","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":