-sanguozhi-057-yufan","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-057","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-057-yufan"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line017","text":"翻與少府孔融書，並示以所著《易注》。融答書曰：\"聞延陵之理樂，睹吾子之治《易》，乃知東南之美者，非徒會稽之竹箭也。又觀象雲物，察應寒溫，原其禍福，與神合契，可謂探賾窮通者也。\"會稽東部都尉張紘又與融書曰：\"虞仲翔前頗為論者所侵，美寶為質，雕摩益光，不足以損。\"","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line017:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"翻","kind":"person","person_id":"izi_e36_p1g","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line017:m0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"融","kind":"person","person_id":"1e4_e5b_007","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line017:m0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"融","kind":"person","person_id":"1e4_e5b_007","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line017:m0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"延陵","kind":"person","person_id":"5dm_e40_rqh_AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line017:m0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"張紘","kind":"person","person_id":"6bz_2xv_ow3","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line017:m0098","start":98,"end":99,"surface":"融","kind":"person","person_id":"1e4_e5b_007","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line017:m0103","start":103,"end":106,"surface":"虞仲翔","kind":"person","person_id":"izi_e36_p1g","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"}],"annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":17,"last_line":17,"revision_id":2638131,"raw_start":2096,"raw_end":2232,"character_positions":[2098,2099,2100,2101,2102,2103,2104,2105,2106,2107,2108,2109,2110,2111,2112,2113,2114,2115,2116,2117,2118,2119,2120,2121,2122,2123,2124,212